estion. The answer is simple: trade. But the game wasn't saying it out loud. This update is about the first ten minutes.What's newCompass. An arrow at the top of the screen points to your current quest target and shows the distance in meters. It hides while menus are open.Clock. The time of day is now in your journal. Quests and the b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T12:31:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032448","verified_at":"2026-10-22T12:50:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5089040-1846651706691211","game_id":"steam-5089040","kind":"announcement","title":"Shadow Bridge Demo — Now Playable at Steam Next Fest","summary":"Hi everyone!The Shadow Bridge demo goes live with the start of Steam Next Fest, so you can jump in and play right away. I’ve spent a long time building this little village between five warring kingdoms, and I can’t wait to see what kind of trader you turn out to be. Give it a try, and let me know what you think — every comment helps!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:48:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691211","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5089040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:19Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:19Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5089040":"2026-10-26T08:02:19Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5089040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:19Z"},"5288380":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:19Z","status":"ok",